hin the FastPose framework for pose estimation and tracking.', 'A specific configuration of the ResNet backbone network, used in FastPose.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2]}, 'ResNet-50': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ['A specific backbone network architecture (ResNet with 50 layers) used within the FastPose framework for pose estimation and tracking.', 'A specific configuration of the ResNet backbone network, used in FastPose.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2]}, 'JointFlow': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ['A method for pose tracking.', 'A state-of-the-art method used for comparison with FastPose on the PoseTrack dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2]}, 'PoseFlow': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ['A method for pose tracking.', 'A state-of-the-art method used for comparison with FastPose on the PoseTrack dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2]}, 'Detect-and-Track': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ['A method for pose tracking.', 'A state-of-the-art method used for comparison with FastPose on the PoseTrack dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2]}, 'FlowTrack': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ['A method for pose tracking.', 'A state-of-the-art method used for comparison with FastPose on the PoseTrack dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2]}, 'SSM': {'type': ['dataset', 'dataset', 'dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for evaluation.', 'A dataset used for evaluating human pose estimation methods.', 'A person search dataset used for training the person Re-ID task.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2]}, 'CPN': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A leading method on COCO 2017 keypoint challenge, involving skip layer feature concatenation and an online hard keypoint mining step.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Region Proposal Network (RPN)': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A fully convolutional network used to propose candidate human bounding boxes.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'RoIAlign': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ['A module used to extract features from regions of interest (RoIs).', 'A method used to extract 14 × 14 feature maps of 512 channels for each proposal in Mask R-CNN and 22 × 16 feature maps in MTN.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 1]}, 'mAP': {'type': ['generic', 'GENERIC', 'generic'], 'description': ['A metric used to evaluate the accuracy of object detection and pose estimation models, representing the mean Average Precision across different object classes or keypoints.', 'Mean Average Precision, a metric used for evaluating the performance of object detection and pose estimation.', 'Mean Average Precision, a metric used to evaluate the performance of pose estimation and person Re-ID tasks.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 2, 2]}, 'MOTA': {'type': ['generic', 'GENERIC', 'generic'], 'description': ['A metric used to evaluate the performance of multi-object tracking algorithms, measuring the accuracy of object detection and tracking.', 'Multiple Object Tracking Accuracy, a metric used for evaluating multi-object tracking performance.', 'Multiple Object Tracking Accuracy, a metric used to evaluate the performance of pose tracking.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 2, 2]}, 'Object Detection': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The task of identifying and locating objects within an image, often involving bounding box regression and classification.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Classification': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The process of assigning a category or label to an object or region within an image.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Mask R-CNN': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A method that efficiently detects objects in an image while simultaneously generating a high-quality segmentation mask for each instance. It is used as a point of reference for the MTN and SIFP methods.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Dilated/Atrous Convolutions': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A technique used in object detection t